{
  "id": "MRK.6",
  "number": "6",
  "bookId": "MRK",
  "reference": "Maliko 6",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 56,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu kūleng'wa mu nzengo go ng'wawe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ū Yesu wīnga a henaho, ūja kū nzengo go ng'wawe, na a bahemba bakwe būnondeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho yashika sabato wingīla ng'wisinagogi, wandya kūlanga. Abo bakang'wigwa bingī būyūkumya balīhaya gīkī, “Bing'we ū ng'wenūyū wīfunije halī pyī ī yenīyī? Winhilwe masala kī a genaya ga kūbeeja na makono gakwe mihayo ya koolecha būdūla būtaale gīko? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wenūyū atī ng'wene ū selemala ū ng'wana Malia, ū nkūlūye o ba Yakobo na Yosefu na Yuda na Simoni? Tūhaya hū ng'wene ūyo na balūmbūye tūkwikalaga nabo ng'wenūmu ūmu!” Yūbatabanya ī mihayo yakwe, bipama! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūbawīla gīkī, “Ū ng'hangi atadalahagwa hose hose ūlū ītī mu nzengo go ng'wawe na mu badūgūye, na mu kaya ya ng'wawe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose ū ng'wenūmo akaduuma ū kwīta nūūlū mhayo gwa koolecha būdūla, ūlū ītī kūbatūūlīla makono basaatu bagehu dūhū na kūbapīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akakumya no kūlwa nguno ya būtūzunya wabo!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūtūng'wa kwa bahemba ikūmi na babīlī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha numa ū Yesu wandya kūja hose pyī ū mu machalo akūlangaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahayīta nose ūbitana abo ikūmi na babīlī, ūbatūma babīlī babīlī, ūbinha na būdūla bo kūheeba myoyo misoso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangī ūbakomeleja, gīkī batizūbūūcha mbūūkanwa jose jose ja kūja najo mu nzīla, ūlū ītī nang'ha dūhū. Yaya nūūlū shilīwa, nūūlū ifulushi, nūūlū mbogoshi ya hela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī shilatū bazwale, gwike batizūzwala ng'hanjo ibīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbawīla gīkī, “Ūlū ng'ūshikīla ha kaya ndebe, ikalagi henaho kūshisha ng'wīnge ī lipandī lyenīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangī ūlū ng'ūshika ipandī ilebe alīyo būlema ū kūng'wanukūla nūūlū kūmudegeleka, īngagi. Ūlū mulīnga ī lipandī lyenīlo, lūkung'unhagi nū lūbuubu ūlo lūlī kū mhambala jing'we, koolekeja gīkī bakūgwīlwa nsango.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana bakaja balīlomeela, gīkī a banhū bagalūke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būpeeja na masamva mingī, na basaatu bingī būbabila maguta, būbapīja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūcha kwa ng'wa Yohana Matīīja",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi Helode wīyigwa ī mihayo yenīyo, nguno ī lina lya ng'wa Yesu līkakumūka. Bangī bahayaga gīkī, “Yohana Matīīja wajūūkile kūfuma mu bafu, h'ī nguno yene ū būdūla ū bose ūbū būkūtūmamaga mulī we.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike bangī bang'hayaga, “Eliya.” Bangī gīkī, “Ng'hangi gīt'ūmo baalī a bahangi ba kale.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Helode aho wigwa ūhaya, “Tambala shilanga ū Yohana ūyo nakamuta ntwe wajūūkile!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū Helode, hū wei ūyo walī walagīla ūding'wa ū Yohana ūponyiwa mu jeela, kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa Helodia ūyo akantoola, alīyo walī nke o ng'wa Filipo ng'wanong'wawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yohana akang'hama ū Helode ūng'wīla gīkī, “Ītī yawiza ū bebe ū kūnsola ū nke o ng'wanong'wing'we!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo gwenūyo gūkansaayīcha no ū Helodia, ūmpelanīla ū Yohana, ūntungīla nhungī; ūng'wikanwa kūmūlaga. Gwike walī waduuma ūmo īītīle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū Helode olī ang'ogohile ū Yohana, olī andeebile gīkī olī munhū ntūngīlīja na ng'wela, na lūūlū olī amaladile. Ahene ozwanganaga ūlū ong'wigwa, alīyo ondegelekaga na būyegi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike nose līkigela ī likanza, nguno lūkashika lūshikū lwa kwizūkwa kūbyalwa kwakwe ū Helode. Ūbeeja shigukulu, ūlaalīka banamhala b'ibanza lyakwe na bataale ba bashilikale, hamò na banangwa ba mu Galilaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna nshīke wa ng'wa Helodia wingīla kūbabinīla, ūnyeja no ū Helode, pye na a bageni bakwe. Ū ntemi ūng'wīla ū ng'wanikī gīkī, “Nilombage shikolo shose shose nakūsambe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ūng'wilahīlīla na kūng'wilahīlīla alīhaya gīkī, “Ūdūgije kūnilomba shose shose, nūūlū īkabiza nusu ya būtemi bone nakūkwinha dūhū!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wanikī ūfuma ū mu chumba, ūūkamūja nina gīkī, “Nalombe kī?” Nang'hwe ūnshokeja, “Ntwe go ng'wa Yohana Matīīja!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho na haho ū ng'wanikī ūshoka ū kūlī ntemi; wiza ūng'wīla, “Nalītogwa ī haha yenīyī ūnisambe ntwe go ng'wa Yohana Matīīja, gūlī ng'wilangahe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi akazwangana kīngī nasho, alīyo īkī walī wamala kūlahīla, nīyo hangī kū būtongi wa babo walī wabalaalīka kwiza kū shilīwa, ūlemeelwa ū kūnemeja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'hana haho na haho ū ntemi ūtūma mūlagi, ūlagīla gwenhwe ng'wilangahe ū ntwe go ng'wa Yohana; ū mūlagi ūja ū mu jeela ūūkamuta ū ntwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūgūtūūla ng'wilangahe wiza ūng'winha ū ng'wanikī, ū ng'wanikī nang'hwe ūūkang'winha nina! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bigwa a bahemba ba ng'wa Yohana biza būgūsola ū mīlī, būūkagūjīka!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūlisha banhū shihūmbī shitanò",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A batūng'wa būshoka ū kūlī Yesu, bibilinga būnsomboolela pyī īyo bakīīta, nī yīyo bakalanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbawīla, “Tūbīngīlagi a banhū tūje kūūnū kūlembeezu mukifuule ho hado.” Nguno a banhū baalī bingī no, bizaga lwīsī lwīsī; ūlū balīnga aba bashika bangī haho na haho. Nose yalī shilambu nūūlū kūpandīka ng'wanya gwa kūlya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'hana bingīla mu lyato būja kwipandī ilembeezu, ūko baalī batīko banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo bamò aho bababona būdeeba ūko bajaga, bandya kūfuma hose hose ū mu mizengo būyūpeela lo magūlū bajile koi, būbatanga ū kūshika ko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ohayika ū Yesu ū mu lyato, aho olībona ī libita ūmo lyalī ū būtaale, ūbasaatwa. Nguno baalī gītī ng'holo jitī na ndīīmi, wandya kūbalanga mihayo mingī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho lyandya kūbiza lya mhīndī būng'wegeela a bahemba bakwe, būng'wīla gīkī, “Ū ng'wenūmu tūlī ng'witogolo dūhū, nīyo nī likanza lyaja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hambū hambū ni wabalaga a banhū baje kū migūnda hihī hihī mu chalo ūmu bakigūlīle na shilīwa!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū wei ūbashokeja ūbawīla, “Binhagi a bing'we ī shilīwa.” Nabo būnshokeja būhaya, “Kolaga hamo shi tūje tūkagūle migatī ya denali magana abīlī hū twize tūbinhe balye?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbabūja, “Mulī na migatī yīnga? Alijagi mukalole!” Aho badeeba būng'wīla, “Ītanò na ndīlo ibīlī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbalagīla babawīle a banhū bigashe mu magele magele ha sī ha maswa, nguno gaalī manīlīzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana bigasha pyī chiza chiza, mu magele magele ga kūbiza aho bigasha banhū igana, aho makūmi atanò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wīsola ī migatī īyo ītanò yenīyo, nī ndīlo būbīlī wajo. Ūlangamīla ng'wigūlū ūlūmba, wīmeganya ī migatī īyo ītanò yenīyo, ūbinha a bahemba bakwe būbagabanhya a banhū. Nī ndīlo ījo ibīlī najo gīko, ūbagabanhya pye a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlya bigeja pye a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna būgasoleela a mamenyagūlwa, pye na a ga ndīlo, bokaja matangwa ikūmi na abīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lisaabu lya bagosha abo bakalya ī migatī yenīyo baalī shihūmbī shitanò.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ūshimīza higūlya ya nyanza",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho na haho ū Yesu ūbakomeleja a bahemba bakwe kwingīla mu lyato batonge kū nkīlo, baje Betisaida; ū wei amalīje kūlīlaga ī libita lya banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahayūmala ū kūbalaga, ūlinha mu lūgūlū kūjūlomba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho būlingīla ū būjikū, ī lyato lyūsangwa līlī kū gatī gatī ya nyanza, ū wei alī iyene kū sī nyūmu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbabona balīkoya ū kūbuga nguno ū nyaga gwabafumīīlaga kū būtongi. Hūna mu madilū mataale ga ngoko ja kwandya, ūbasanga ko alīshimīza higūlya ya nyanza. Wīta gītī alīhaya kūbabītīīla; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aho bamona alīshimīza higūlya ya nyanza, bakiganika līng'hangi būyoganya balīlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno pye bakamona bogoha kīngī nasho! Alīyo ū wei ūbayombya haho na haho alībawīla, “Timbyagi ng'holò, mutogohage nalī nene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūlinha nang'hwe ū mu lyato, goya na koya ū kūhuuyemba ū nyaga. Bakakumya no būjinjimala, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nguno baalī bataalī ū kūyitegeleja ī mihayo ya migatī. Ī myoyo yabo yalī ītaalī midito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūpīja basaatu Genesaleti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna būshika ha ng'walo gwa kū sī ya Genesaleti, būkola henaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bika ū mu lyato haho na haho a banhū būndeeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bandya kūpeela kūja hose hose ū mu mapandī genayo; būyūbenha a basaatu, abo baalī batadūgije kūshimīza, būyūbatūūla ha būlīīlī bababūūcha babatwala būlī kwene ūko bang'wigwīlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno wajaga hose hose, kū magūngūli, mu mizengo, pyī nū kū matogolo. Akaja na kwigūlilū, nū kwene būng'wenhela bingī abo baalī na makoye, būyūng'wikūmbīlīja bakuumye nūūlū ha neno ya shizwalo shakwe dūhū. Na ng'hana būlī bene abo bankuumyaga bapīlaga.",
